    {
      "id": "p2-core-principle",
      "eyebrow": "核心原理",
      "title": "Function calling 是什么",
      "content": {
        "kind": "formula",
        "items": [
          "LLM接收自然语言输入",
          "根据tools/functions参数中的schema定义",
          "生成函数名和参数(仅参数,不执行代码)",
          "返回结构化调用结果给对话系统"
        ],
        "conclusion": "本质:LLM将自然语言映射到预定义函数接口"
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "Function calling 本质是 LLM 的能力映射。",
          "audio": "audio/function-calling-stability/p2-core-principle-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "它接收自然语言输入,根据我们预定义的 schema 生成函数调用。",
          "audio": "audio/function-calling-stability/p2-core-principle-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "注意,模型只返回函数名和参数,不会直接执行代码,保证安全可控。",
          "audio": "audio/function-calling-stability/p2-core-principle-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "然后这些调用结果会传回对话系统,完成多轮交互。",
          "audio": "audio/function-calling-stability/p2-core-principle-s3.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "fragments": [
