    {
      "id": "p4-protection-mechanisms",
      "eyebrow": "保障机制",
      "title": "四层防护策略",
      "content": {
        "kind": "code",
        "language": "python",
        "lines": [
          {
            "code": "# 1. 严格定义 JSON Schema",
            "comment": "类型/必填/枚举/格式约束",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "def get_weather(",
            "comment": "    \"description\": \"获取指定城市的天气\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"city\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"北京\", \"上海\"]}}, \"required\": [\"city\"]}",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "",
            "comment": "",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "# 2. 参数验证层",
            "comment": "解析后校验类型/范围/业务规则",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "def validate_args(args):",
            "comment": "    if 'city' not in args: raise ValidationError",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "",
            "comment": "",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "# 3. 重试机制",
            "comment": "解析/验证失败时重新生成,最多2-3次",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "for attempt in range(3):",
            "comment": "    try: response = parse_and_validate()",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "",
            "comment": "",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "# 4. 强类型解析",
            "comment": "使用 Pydantic 提供友好错误信息",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "class WeatherRequest(BaseModel):",
            "comment": "    city: Literal['北京', '上海']",
            "highlight": null
          }
        ],
        "note": "四层防护:Schema定义→参数验证→自动重试→强类型解析"
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "保障稳定性需要四层防护策略。",
          "audio": "audio/function-calling-stability/p4-protection-mechanisms-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第一层是严格定义 JSON Schema,包括类型、必填字段、枚举值和格式约束。",
          "audio": "audio/function-calling-stability/p4-protection-mechanisms-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第二层是参数验证,在解析后校验类型、范围、必填字段和业务规则。",
          "audio": "audio/function-calling-stability/p4-protection-mechanisms-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第三层是重试机制,当解析或验证失败时让模型重新生成,最多重试两到三次。",
          "audio": "audio/function-calling-stability/p4-protection-mechanisms-s3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第四层使用强类型数据模型,比如 Pydantic,提供友好的错误提示。",
          "audio": "audio/function-calling-stability/p4-protection-mechanisms-s4.mp3"
        }
      ],
